WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.751 --> 00:00:21.608
Zippy zoomed around the spaceport.

2
00:00:21.609 --> 00:00:25.991
Trucks jumped out of the way.

3
00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:30.365
Zippy laughed.

4
00:00:30.366 --> 00:00:33.333
Then he gasped.

5
00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:37.079
Zippy was speeding toward a truck.

6
00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:40.220
The truck was carrying a satellite.

7
00:00:40.221 --> 00:00:45.336
Zippy slammed his brakes and slid.

8
00:00:45.337 --> 00:00:48.293
Bam!

9
00:00:48.294 --> 00:01:02.467
Zippy crashed into the truck.

10
00:01:02.468 --> 00:01:06.370
"My wheel is broken!" the truck said.

11
00:01:06.371 --> 00:01:14.475
"I can't bring Rocky this satellite."

12
00:01:14.476 --> 00:01:20.194
"Jeb and I can help!" Eddy said.

13
00:01:20.195 --> 00:01:27.156
Eddy and Jeb hurried over.

14
00:01:27.157 --> 00:01:30.877
Jeb picked up the satellite.

15
00:01:30.878 --> 00:01:37.637
He put it in Eddy's dumper.

16
00:01:37.638 --> 00:01:47.163
Eddy drove it to Rocky.

17
00:01:47.164 --> 00:01:49.939
Ms. Fender went to Zippy.

18
00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:54.385
"You're in big trouble," she said.

19
00:01:54.386 --> 00:01:57.231
"Get ready!" a voice said.

20
00:01:57.232 --> 00:02:00.164
"Blastoff is in ten seconds!"

21
00:02:00.165 --> 00:02:12.821
Everyone counted down.

22
00:02:12.822 --> 00:02:16.336
"Good-bye!" Rocky said.

23
00:02:16.337 --> 00:02:19.009
Rumble! Rumble!

24
00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:26.982
Rocky blasted off.

25
00:02:26.983 --> 00:02:35.268
Eddy waved. "Bye, Rocky!"
